sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Claude as Claude Code
    participant File as issue-N.md

    User->>Claude: /implement
    Claude->>File: Create issue file
    Claude->>Claude: Implementation Agent: code + tests
    Claude->>File: Implementation Notes - Attempt 1
    Claude->>Claude: Critic Agent: review quality + constraints
    Claude->>File: Critic Review
    Claude-->>User: ━ CHECKPOINT 1 ━
    User->>Claude: continue
    alt high-risk files changed
        Claude->>Claude: Security Agent: OWASP + STRIDE
        Claude->>File: Security Review
        Claude-->>User: ━ CHECKPOINT 2 ━
        User->>Claude: continue
    end
    Claude->>Claude: Testing Agent: run suite + criteria
    Claude->>File: Test Results
    Claude-->>User: ━ CHECKPOINT 3 ━
    User->>Claude: /commit #N
    Claude->>File: Verification & Commit
    Claude-->>User: committed, issue closed
